    description: "Aliya Hallow's beasts in sealed state: six spirits maintained simultaneously from the Emperor's mana-memory of Valariyans at the moment of their death, given form as a Beast rather than a Phoenix — reclassified during the Acana event once the true shape of Cycle (below) made clear which of the two forms actually belonged to which sibling core. In its true unsealed state, Soul's gives way entirely to something else: the Six Spirits of Irane, each a manifest expression of one of the perfected command and will cores that make up Irane's own architecture — not a memory of the Valariyan dead, but Irane's own nature given form.",
